  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>TerraFirmaGreg-Core</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>TerraFirmaGreg-Core - Modern</strong> 是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/terrafirmagreg-modern\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerrraFirmaGreg-Modern</a> 整合包的基礎架構，包含了所有跨模組的整合與相容性程式碼。此外還涵蓋了大量的 Mixins。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrafirmagreg.su%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/TerraFirmaGreg-Team/.github/blob/main/branding/button/brands/discord_logo_32x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/TerraFirmaGreg-Team/Modpack-Modern\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/TerraFirmaGreg-Team/.github/blob/main/branding/button/brands/github_logo_32x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Github\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrafirmagreg-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/TerraFirmaGreg-Team/.github/blob/main/branding/button/brands/curseforge_logo_32x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fterrafirmagreg-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/TerraFirmaGreg-Team/.github/blob/main/branding/button/brands/modrinth_logo_32x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p>",
